	<item>
		<title>Carlos Guestrin named as new Director of the Stanford AI Lab!</title>
		<link>https://ai.stanford.edu/news/carlos-guestrin-named-as-new-director-of-the-stanford-ai-lab/</link>
					<comments>https://ai.stanford.edu/news/carlos-guestrin-named-as-new-director-of-the-stanford-ai-lab/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Cindy Duong]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 20:54:49 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://ai.stanford.edu/?p=5127</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[We thank Christopher Manning for being Director of the Stanford AI Lab during a period of enormous growth for AI and SAIL from 2018–2025 and today welcome Carlos Guestrin, Fortinet Founders Professor of Computer Science, as the new Director of SAIL.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>We thank Christopher Manning for being Director of the Stanford AI Lab during a period of enormous growth for AI and SAIL from 2018–2025 and today welcome Carlos Guestrin, Fortinet Founders Professor of Computer Science, as the new Director of SAIL.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
